### Obtener negocio por slug
GET http://localhost:3000/api/businesses/barberia-tony

### Listar servicios
GET http://localhost:3000/api/businesses/barberia-tony/services

### Listar profesionales
GET http://localhost:3000/api/businesses/barberia-tony/professionals

### Crear una reserva (ajusta la fecha a mañana)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "businessSlug": "barberia-tony",
  "serviceId": "50e9c8b8-a41e-4d91-b15e-fdd8ae70f9ec",
  "professionalId": "0c9dc4af-7d46-4a85-aaee-1d73c2884e3e",
  "clientName": "Benjamin Guzman",
  "clientPhone": "+56912345678",
  "clientEmail": "benjabenjita@email.com",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-04-16T14:00:00-04:00",
  "notes": "Servicio excelente"
}

### Registrar cuenta del dueño
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tony@barberia.com",
  "password": "segura123",
  "businessSlug": "barberia-tony"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tony@barberia.com",
  "password": "segura123"
}

### Probar endpoint protegido con el token del login
GET http://localhost:3000/api/businesses/barberia-tony/appointments
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJFUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6ImQ2ZTRhZTk3LTQyODYtNDAxYy1hMWU4LWY0ZDMwNDNkZDA5NyIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..qPeWhKPSiMEAloflutbau-ssMSRs_gppZttRhXiD1qbEK1A2t6DYa3U08lpdRpG_U1u9EpgNVaJMEZtsF7vnyw

### Probar sin token — debe devolver 401
GET http://localhost:3000/api/businesses/barberia-tony/appointments






### 1. Obtener IDs reales del negocio
GET http://localhost:3000/api/businesses/barberia-tony/services

###
GET http://localhost:3000/api/businesses/barberia-tony/professionals

### 2. Consulta de disponibilidad básica (reemplaza los UUIDs)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/availability?businessSlug=barberia-tony&professionalId=0c9dc4af-7d46-4a85-aaee-1d73c2884e3e&serviceId=9490ecd8-73b6-4961-ac15-6a425e986242&date=2026-04-15

### 3. Con intervalo de 15 minutos
GET http://localhost:3000/api/availability?businessSlug=barberia-tony&professionalId=0c9dc4af-7d46-4a85-aaee-1d73c2884e3e&serviceId=9490ecd8-73b6-4961-ac15-6a425e986242&date=2026-04-15&interval=15

### 4. Día sin horario (domingo = día 0)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/availability?businessSlug=barberia-tony&professionalId=0c9dc4af-7d46-4a85-aaee-1d73c2884e3e&serviceId=9490ecd8-73b6-4961-ac15-6a425e986242&date=2026-04-12

### 5. Fecha pasada — debe dar 400
GET http://localhost:3000/api/availability?businessSlug=barberia-tony&professionalId=0c9dc4af-7d46-4a85-aaee-1d73c2884e3e&serviceId=9490ecd8-73b6-4961-ac15-6a425e986242&date=2024-01-01

### 6. Sin parámetros — debe dar 400 con lista de faltantes
GET http://localhost:3000/api/availability


### Crear reserva con tu número real (debe estar en el sandbox)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "businessSlug":   "barberia-tony",
  "serviceId":      "9490ecd8-73b6-4961-ac15-6a425e986242",
  "professionalId": "0c9dc4af-7d46-4a85-aaee-1d73c2884e3e",
  "clientName":     "me gustas mucho montse",
  "clientPhone":    "+56995904020",
  "scheduledAt":    "2026-04-20T10:00:00-05:00"
}


