### Summary del dashboard
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dashboard/barberia-tony/summary
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN

### Reservas por día (últimos 14 días)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dashboard/barberia-tony/by-period?period=day&limit=14
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN

### Crear servicio nuevo
POST http://localhost:3000/api/admin/barberia-tony/services
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Coloración", "duration_min": 90, "price": 25000 }

### Reemplazar horarios de un profesional
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/admin/barberia-tony/schedules/UUID-DEL-PROFESIONAL
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "schedules": [
    { "day_of_week": 1, "start_time": "09:00", "end_time": "18:00" },
    { "day_of_week": 2, "start_time": "09:00", "end_time": "18:00" },
    { "day_of_week": 3, "start_time": "09:00", "end_time": "18:00" },
    { "day_of_week": 4, "start_time": "09:00", "end_time": "18:00" },
    { "day_of_week": 5, "start_time": "09:00", "end_time": "16:00" }
  ]
}